  "title": "Perfect Cut-Out Cookie Dough",
  "description": "This recipe for cut-out cookies is made with butter and powdered sugar. You may use different extracts and add spices. For fall, I use maple extract and add cinnamon and nutmeg.",
  "authors": [
    "Sarah Z"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-06-08T10:09:06-04:00",
